text This doesn't happen often, but I am up pretty early.
text And that would be because I went to bed early last night.
text As I eat a light breakfast, I gaze at an morning program I don't recognize on the television screen.
text Other than the sound coming from the television, there is no other noise in my house.
text My old man... is probably still asleep.
text My hand naturally reaches for the remote control.
text And I turn the volume down.
text It's not that I'm worried about him still being asleep.
text It's just... I really don't want him to wake up because of the noise.
text I look at the clock.
text Normally, I would still be asleep.
text There's no better time to start going to school than now.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...Guess I'll go to school on time once in a while.
text I stand up, grab my bag, and walk toward the front door while trying to make as little noise as possible in the process.
