text It's a unfamiliar sight.
text Around me are a bunch of people wearing the same uniform as I am, all walking in the same direction.
text There are people walking by themselves, and groups of people who are talking as they walk.
text There aren't many of them, but there are couples too.
text @[Tomoya]
text (...Couples, huh...?)
text That reminds me. Fujibayashi and I are going out...
text And even though we had a third wheel, we were on a date.
text So does that mean... I'll be going to school in the mornings with her from time to time...?
text Nah... I don't see that happening.
text I doubt she would ask me to, and I would never ask her.
text No, actually... there's one way I can see it happening...
text If her sister sets it up, it's not out of the question...
text ...Going to school with a girl, huh...?
text ......
text Whoa... that sounds really embarrassing.
