text @[Tomoya]
text Hm? Yeah, I'm fine.
sound 9UY.aac
text @[Ryou]
text I-Is that so?
text Her hands nervously and frantically move on her lap.
text I can faintly feel warmth drifting toward my thighs.
text That goes to show how close we are sitting.
text I suppose for Fujibayashi, it's close enough to get her to faint from embarrassment.
sound 9UZ.aac
text @[Kyou]
text Now, let's dig in!  Our main dish today is pork cutlets, slightly seasoned with soy sauce!
text Kyou says cheerfully, purposefully ignoring her sister's reaction.
text She lays out the lunch box's three layers.
text Even if you look at it as a layer for each of us, that's still quite a lot.
text All of us start eating from the lunch box, picking from it what we like.
